   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But how can this be done for you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Unless someone is born of water and the Spirit",
